                <g><path d="M10.375,3.219,6,6.719l-4.375-3.5A1,1,0,1,0,.375,4.781l5,4a1,1,0,0,0,1.25,0l5-4a1,1,0,0,0-1.25-1.562Z"></path></g>
              </svg></p>
